    <section v-if="tab==='overview'" class="studio-course-layout"><div class="course-overview-main"><article class="course-next-action"><div><span class="studio-kicker">SMALL STEPS, REAL PROGRESS</span><h2>{{ overview?.today_tasks.length?'接下来，只专注这一小步。':'今天，也为理解留一点时间。' }}</h2><p>{{ overview?.today_tasks[0]?.title || '翻开资料，整理一个知识点，或向拾意提出一个好问题。' }}</p><button class="btn primary" @click="changeTab(overview?.today_tasks.length?'study-plan':'tutor')">{{ overview?.today_tasks.length?'开始今日任务':'带着问题开始' }}<ArrowUpRight :size="15"/></button></div><span class="next-action-art" aria-hidden="true"><BookOpen :size="65" :stroke-width=".8"/><Sparkles :size="23"/></span></article>
      <div class="learning-metrics overview-metrics"><article v-for="(key,index) in ['materials','knowledge_points','mastery','plan_completion']" :key="key" class="learning-card"><template v-if="overview?.metrics[key]"><span class="metric-topline"><component :is="[FileText,Waypoints,Sparkles,CheckCheck][index]" :size="16"/><small>{{ names[key] }}</small></span><strong>{{ metricText(key,overview.metrics[key]!) }}</strong><small>{{ overview.metrics[key]!.sample_size }} {{ ['份资料','个知识点','个已确认知识点','项计划任务'][index] }} · {{ index>1?'课程累计':'当前课程' }}</small></template></article></div>
      <WeekStrip v-if="plan" :today="plan.today" :tasks="plan.tasks" :selected-date="selectedDay" @select="selectedDay=$event" @plan="changeTab('study-plan')"/>
      <article class="day-task-card"><div class="shelf-heading"><div><span class="studio-kicker">ONE THING AT A TIME</span><h2>{{ selectedDay===(plan?.today||dateToday)?'今天的小目标':selectedDay+' 的安排' }}</h2></div><span class="task-count">{{ datedTasks.length }} 项</span></div><div v-if="!datedTasks.length" class="task-quiet"><span><Check :size="20"/></span><div><strong>给这一天留一点自由。</strong><p>暂无安排，可以回顾错题，也可以提出一个新问题。</p></div><button class="text-button" @click="changeTab('review')">去温习 <ArrowUpRight :size="14"/></button></div><div v-for="(task,index) in datedTasks" :key="task.id" class="journal-task" :class="{done:task.status==='completed'}"><button class="task-checkbox" :disabled="busy||task.status!=='pending'" :aria-label="task.status==='completed'?'已完成 '+task.title:'完成 '+task.title" @click="taskAction(task.id,'completed')"><Check v-if="task.status==='completed'" :size="14"/><Circle v-else :size="18"/></button><span class="task-order">{{ String(index+1).padStart(2,'0') }}</span><div><h3>{{ task.title }}</h3><small>{{ {pending:'待完成',completed:'已完成',blocked:'暂时无法完成',skipped:'已跳过'}[task.status] }} · {{ task.minutes }} 分钟</small></div><span class="task-time"><Clock3 :size="12"/>{{ task.minutes }} MIN</span></div><button v-if="todayTasks.length>datedTasks.filter(t=>t.status==='pending').length" class="text-button overdue-link" @click="changeTab('study-plan')">还有此前未完成的安排，去计划页查看 <ArrowRight :size="13"/></button></article>
      <div class="overview-shortcuts"><button @click="changeTab('materials')"><span class="shortcut-symbol"><FileText :size="22"/></span><div><small>YOUR SOURCE OF TRUTH</small><h3>资料收纳盒</h3><p>查看原文与解析状态</p></div><ArrowUpRight :size="20"/></button><button @click="changeTab('practice')"><span class="shortcut-symbol"><Target :size="22"/></span><div><small>KNOW IT. TRY IT.</small><h3>来一道，检验理解</h3><p>从资料中生成练习草稿</p></div><ArrowUpRight :size="20"/></button></div>
    </div><aside class="studio-side"><FocusTimer :key="selected.id"/><StudyOrbit :points="points" @open="changeTab('outline')"/><article class="course-progress-note"><span class="studio-kicker">YOUR OWN PACE</span><strong>{{ courseCoverage }}<small>%</small></strong><div class="journal-progress"><i :style="{width:Math.min(100,courseCoverage)+'%'}"/></div><p>已完成 {{ completedTasks }} 项计划任务。<br>每一小步，都会留下痕迹。</p><small>计划完成比例 · 跳过任务不计入分母</small></article></aside></section>
    <section v-if="tab==='materials'" class="learning-stack">
      <article class="learning-card"><h2>课程资料</h2><p>支持 PDF、DOCX、PPTX、文本和图片。旧版 .ppt 请转换为 .pptx。PPTX 限 300 页、解压后 200 MiB，上传文件限 {{ maxUploadMb }} MB。</p><div class="learning-actions"><select v-model="materialType" aria-label="资料类型"><option value="lecture">讲义</option><option value="textbook">教材</option><option value="exam">试卷</option><option value="notes">笔记</option><option value="answers">参考答案</option><option value="presentation">演示文稿</option></select><button class="btn primary" :disabled="busy" @click="uploadInput?.click()">{{ busy?'处理中…':'上传资料' }}</button><input ref="uploadInput" hidden type="file" multiple accept=".pdf,.docx,.pptx,.txt,.md,.csv,.json,.html,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.webp" @change="upload"/></div></article>
      <article v-for="m in materials" :key="m.id" class="learning-card"><div class="learning-row"><div><h3>{{ m.name }}</h3><small>{{ m.file_type.toUpperCase() }} · {{ m.slide_count?m.slide_count+' 页幻灯片':m.chunk_count+' 个知识片段' }}</small></div><span class="learning-chip">{{ m.parse_status==='vision_pending'?(m.active_revision_id?'新版待视觉解析 · 旧版可用':'需要视觉解析'):({ready:'已可检索',queued:'等待处理',processing:'处理中',failed:'处理失败',vision_pending:'需要视觉解析'}[m.status]||m.status) }}</span></div><p v-if="jobs[m.id]">{{ jobs[m.id]?.stage }} · {{ jobs[m.id]?.progress }}% · {{ jobs[m.id]?.processed_pages }}/{{ jobs[m.id]?.total_pages }} {{ m.file_type==='pptx'?'页幻灯片':'页' }}</p><p v-if="m.unparsed_objects">未解析对象：{{ m.unparsed_objects }}（动画、媒体或未描述图片等）</p><p v-if="m.error" role="alert">{{ m.error }}</p><div class="learning-actions"><select :value="m.material_metadata.unit_id||''" aria-label="资料所属章节" @change="metadata(m,'unit_id',($event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value)"><option value="">未指定章节</option><option v-for="u in units" :key="u.id" :value="u.id">{{ u.title }}</option></select><button class="btn secondary" @click="inspect(m)">来源与解析详情</button><button v-if="['failed','vision_pending'].includes(m.parse_status||m.status)" class="btn secondary" :disabled="busy" @click="retryMaterial(m)">重试解析</button></div></article>
